WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:16.200
Playing final fantasy is an exercise of love—but even the most ardent fans can agree: the plots are full of

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:22.340
what in academiawe call ‘what the fuck’ type moments: Are all Cloud’s memories fake?

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:26.529
Is that really how inter-dimensional time travel works? People might wonder: why is Sarah

00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:31.720
a crystal now? And my personal favorite...how is Tidus a dream? Not that he is dreaming,

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:35.390
Tidus literally IS a dream...You know how
many people have played a Final Fantasy game?

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:40.610
A lot. You know how many can accurately recount
the plot of one of these games? Very few.

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:45.199
Despite needlessly convoluted storytelling,
the thing that fans latch on to is the wonderfully

00:00:45.199 --> 00:00:50.300
complex characters and their personal struggles.Even though each installment introduces a new cast,

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.739
there’s a significant amount of thematic
overlap that ties these characters together

00:00:53.739 --> 00:00:55.909
and keeps the fans coming back for more.

00:00:55.909 --> 00:01:00.220
At its core, Final Fantasy is a series of
games that explores the intricacies of dreams,

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.160
desires, spiritual environmentalism and well... phantasy.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:10.040
I'm Jared, and this is final fantasy and psychology.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:14.260
On one level, Final fantasy is an exploration
of the unconscious—it’s a jaunt into the

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:18.500
world of dreams. There’s a difference between
fantasy and the psychoanalytic concept of

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:20.220
phantasy with a (ph).

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:24.790
What we traditionally think of as fantasy
is something like daydreams, wishes, or desires.

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:29.580
Such as Vaan’s dreams of being a sky pirate in FF12 - or Cid dreaming of being an astronaut

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:32.440
in FF7, or Terra dreaming of her past in FF6.

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:37.910
Phantasy(with a ph) is the unconscious drives behind our actions that we are unaware of and

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:41.190
throughout the series we often see physical
manifestations of the unconscious.

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:46.450
Tidus is always dreaming about how much he
hates his alcoholic father, and in the same

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:51.060
game Seymore makes the comment that he can smell the Farplane on Auron.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:55.160
The Farplane is a sort of literary allusion
to the underworld or the dream world.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:59.290
In final fantasy six they literally visit
the dream world, the land of the Espers, and

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:03.560
fight the dream stooges: Larry, Curly, and
Moe—who [beyond the three stooges reference]

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:08.020
are sort of ironicstand ins for the id, ego,
and superego. In Final Fantasy seven when

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:12.069
Tifa and Cloud fall into the lifestream they
enter clouds unconscious memories.

00:02:12.069 --> 00:02:16.090
In traditional psychoanalysis the analyst talks the patient through the process of naming

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:20.349
their unconscious phantasies and attaching language to them so that they can work out their

00:02:20.349 --> 00:02:21.599
maladies and traumas.

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:25.590
Encountering and working through trauma is
one of the defining themes of the Final Fantasy

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:29.599
games. FF characters always have a ton of
psychological baggage.

00:02:29.599 --> 00:02:33.379
Cyan is tasked with seeing his family on the
phantom train that carries the dead to the

00:02:33.379 --> 00:02:34.349
other side.

00:02:34.349 --> 00:02:37.599
Cloud goes through a whole wreck of trauma,
between the loss of his friend, the burning

00:02:37.599 --> 00:02:42.319
of his hometown, and Hojo’s experiments
messing with his memories, Cloud is basically

00:02:42.319 --> 00:02:43.060
broken...

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.760
And his initial reaction to trauma isn’t
the greatest.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:51.700
Zidanecracks when he finds out he is a genome—a
“manufactured soulless being”...you know,

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:55.300
In final fantasy ten spirits become vengeful
if they can’t overcome the trauma of their

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:59.459
death and Rex (from Final Fantasy twelve)
is so shaken by surviving the murder of his

00:02:59.459 --> 00:03:01.639
family that he is institutionalized.

00:03:01.639 --> 00:03:05.540
Then there is the sorry case of Vivi, the
saddest little scarecrow in blackface, in

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:06.650
the history of gaming.

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:11.040
His loss is not just the mourning of a friend
or loved one—it is something akin to Freud’s

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:16.379
discussion of melancholia, of a self directed sadness beyond object loss—what Vivi has

00:03:16.379 --> 00:03:20.639
lost can never be regained, the innocence
of youth, of the belief in immortality.

00:03:20.639 --> 00:03:25.529
Vivi finds out that he is just a mass produced
war doll with a shelf life of about a year.

00:03:25.529 --> 00:03:30.599
The mage is just sort of wakes up to consciousness—are thrown into the world like Frankenstein’s

00:03:30.599 --> 00:03:34.109
monster—disconnected from their creator and radically without purpose.

00:03:34.109 --> 00:03:38.409
This existential quagmire is a microcosm for
the human condition, as finite beings we all

00:03:38.409 --> 00:03:42.319
grapple with the question: “what does it
mean to be a being that will one day die?”

00:03:42.319 --> 00:03:46.359
How is he supposed to go on with this knowledge seems to be his central character arch and

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:51.010
the hint is there, the name Vivi, is literally
Italian for life: so the answer—find a way

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:51.840
to live.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:55.900
One reaction to Trauma is also one of the
best parts of Soap Operas: amnesia. The way

00:03:55.900 --> 00:04:00.269
soap operas write characters that they have
killed back onto the show is pretty hilarious:

00:04:00.269 --> 00:04:04.950
no, your favorite soap hunk isn’t really
dead, he has amnesia, or he is really his

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:06.859
evil twin.

00:04:06.859 --> 00:04:12.180
I wish that Final Fantasy were different...I
really wish that it was, going back over these

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:15.799
games the most frequent plot hole fix: is
of course, amnesia...

00:04:15.799 --> 00:04:20.209
In final Fantasy six, Terra can’t remember
being an Esper and Rachel falls off of a bridge

00:04:20.209 --> 00:04:24.990
and loses her memories, in seven Cloud has
all sorts of false memories, in Final Fantasy

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:30.169
eight Selphie, Quistis, Seipher, Ellone, Zell,
and Squallwere all somehow suppressing a memory

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:32.530
of living in an orphanage together as kids.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:36.759
In Final Fantasy nine Fratley is suffering
from amnesia, Garnett forgot a giant eye in

00:04:36.759 --> 00:04:38.940
the sky that destroyed her city, and Fang has

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:41.599
in final fantasy thirteen also has amnesia.

00:04:41.599 --> 00:04:46.889
But none of this compares to Tidus, yeah we
are going there again, what the fuck? Tidus

00:04:46.889 --> 00:04:50.819
doesn’t just have amnesia, he has forgotten
that he isn’t a real boy, he is actually...a

00:04:50.819 --> 00:04:57.050
dream. I’m sorry, I just can’t get over
this.

00:04:57.050 --> 00:05:00.750
When people think of the “Fantasy” element of Final Fantasy they often think of something

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:05.129
like LAARPING and the magic that gives it
the fantasy feel. But lest we forget that some

00:05:05.129 --> 00:05:10.479
are decidedly sci-fi, the real phantasy that
binds these games is a struggle with trauma.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:20.440
While each big boss has an interesting justification
for their actions—most also act as a

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:24.940
response to trauma. Looking for a way to explain the motivation of soldiers returning from

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:29.669
world war I, afflicted with motivation that
was inexplicable using his drives based on

00:05:29.669 --> 00:05:35.199
Eros or sexuality—Freud coined the term:
the Death Drive or Death Instinct... sometimes

00:05:35.199 --> 00:05:36.349
called Thanatos.

00:05:36.349 --> 00:05:40.270
The death drive is an instinct or a drive
towards self destruction—it’s a desire

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:45.099
to return to inorganic chemistry—where all
desires are satisfied—it is a desire to

00:05:45.099 --> 00:05:49.240
be free of conflict or suffering. Kind of
like curling up on a couch with some ice cream

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:54.190
and Sherlock forever. This manifests in a desire either for self annihilation or apotheosis

00:05:54.190 --> 00:06:03.020
(a desire to transforminto a god), and much
like Prometheus, Phaethon, or Icarus—cutting

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:05.810
corners on a path to divinity doesn't usually
end well.

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:10.400
In Final Fantasy nine Kuja’s response to
his finitude and inevitable impending death is:

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:13.280
destroy all life with him, in one blaze of glory.

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:17.960
In Final Fantasy seven Sephioroth is an abandoned
and lonely soul that attempts to gain ultimate

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:22.340
power by harnessing the lifestream of the
planet by hitting it with a giant meteor.

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:26.979
Many of these antagonists justify their actions
from the perspective of negative utilitarianism.

00:06:26.979 --> 00:06:31.810
Unlike traditional utilitarianism that attempts
to maximize happiness, negative utilitarianism

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:33.930
is about minimizing suffering.

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:37.979
And the surest way to insure that there is
net less suffering forever is to quickly snuff

00:06:37.979 --> 00:06:40.990
out all life so that it can never suffer again.

00:06:40.990 --> 00:06:44.669
In Final Fantasy thirteen the Fal’C want
to eliminate all disharmony and suffering

00:06:44.669 --> 00:06:49.349
by bringing back the maker to reestablish
order and peace.

00:06:49.349 --> 00:06:53.430
In Final Fantasy ten, Seymour grew up with
all of the suffering, taunting, and harassment

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:57.310
of being a half-breed. So his solution? Help Sin destroy all of Spira

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:00.000
to end all suffering on the planet.

00:07:09.039 --> 00:07:12.860
With all of the crystals in the final fantasy
series, overlooking the new age spirituality

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:18.810
would be a mistake, exemplified by shops that
sell incense, wind chimes, Australian Didgeridoos,

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.639
polished rocks, and a lot of crystals.

00:07:20.639 --> 00:07:25.020
The new age movement gained traction in the 1970’s and is an amalgam of spiritual beliefs

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:27.689
that stressed holistic divinity and the interconnectedness

00:07:27.689 --> 00:07:28.699
of all life.

00:07:28.699 --> 00:07:33.580
While not necessarily related to New Age spirituality, The Gaia Hypothesis is similar in that it

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:38.710
asserts that the earth is one harmonious living system—and disrupting that system has serious

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:41.360
implications for everyone living on the Earth.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:45.729
Final Fantasy seems to take a lot of inspiration from the Gaia hypothesis. In Final Fantasy

00:07:45.729 --> 00:07:50.349
seven all life goes back to the planet as
lifestream, in Final Fantasy twelve, nine,

00:07:50.349 --> 00:07:55.680
and seven the planet is aptly named Gaia.
Whether it’s an evil corporation or a megalomaniac

00:07:55.680 --> 00:08:00.659
moving crystals or statues around—the games focus on balance with the environment. And

00:08:00.659 --> 00:08:03.430
as such, is full of environmentalist undertones.

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:08.099
In seven Cloud is in cahoots with an environmental terrorist group that challenges the exploitative

00:08:08.099 --> 00:08:13.669
Shinra corporation. The Al Behd in final fantasy ten are the last users of machina(a type of

00:08:13.669 --> 00:08:19.120
technology)... whereas most of the world is anti technology. Sin is sort of like a mix between the

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:24.660
Unabomber and the Sea Shepard...if they were a giant whale beast... thing. Its purpose

00:08:24.669 --> 00:08:29.650
for existence it to punish people for using
technology. But to focus just on technology

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.830
misses out on the root of the problem.

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:36.240
Something more is going on than your usual
captain planet, tree hugger affair. Final

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:39.419
Fantasy seven tips it’s hat, with the introduction
of a minor character: Heidegger.

00:08:39.419 --> 00:08:44.730
That’s right, The Notorious Martin, himself,
the master of being and time makes an appearance

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:47.649
as the head of public safety for the Shinra
corporation.

00:08:47.649 --> 00:08:53.139
In his work "The Question of Technology? Martin
Heidegger asks: what is the essence of Technology?

00:08:53.139 --> 00:08:58.100
Heidegger's answer: nothing technological-rather
the drive to technology is based not in machines

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:02.070
but in a particular type of thinking and seeing
called enframing.

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:07.190
Enframing renders the totality of the field
of vision, or the earth, to bestand-or standing

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:10.430
reserve, as matter simply waiting to be exploited
for us.

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:14.600
The way the Shinra Corporation merely sees
lifestream as a means to make the profitable

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:20.410
substance mako, or how Draklor laboratories
artificially create nethicite, how the fal’C

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:25.589
are enslaved to power the citiesof Cocoon
or extracting magic from Espersare all examples

00:09:25.589 --> 00:09:26.279
of enframing.

00:09:26.279 --> 00:09:32.350
It stems from an in-authentic need to master
and control the world—to settle the wilderness—to

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:37.170
pacify the precocity of life by making everything
needed ready at hand. However, —the urge

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:39.420
to mastery doesn’t just end at objects.

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:43.980
When humanity views life from the perspective
of instrumentality, human beings themselves

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:49.370
are seen as standing reserve—as materials,
as a means to an end: it’s a form of objectification

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:50.750
and subjugation.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:54.450
Throughout the entirety of the series there
are odd parallels between the world and politics

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:57.899
of Final Fantasy and the fascist, genocidal
regimes of earth.

00:09:57.899 --> 00:10:02.310
A couple of shared elements might be a coincidence but Final fantasy four’s murderous antagonist

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:06.910
is called Golbez, which bears a striking resemblance to the minister of propaganda for the Nazi

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:08.620
Reich: Paul Joseph Goebbels.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:13.020
Jewish imagery is interspersed throughout
the games: Sephiroth is close to Sephirot,

00:10:13.029 --> 00:10:14.560
the ten attributes of god.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:18.980
Final fantasy thirteen takes place under the
backdrop of the relocation and mass execution

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:24.550
of the l’cie called the purge... l’cie
are a branded people chosen by Fal’c gods

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:28.519
and final fantasy seven takes place under
the guise that they will return to the promise

00:10:28.519 --> 00:10:32.980
land... complete with a Joseph Mengele like character in the maniacal Hojo. (Mengele,

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:37.620
of course, was one of the Nazi doctors responsible
for selecting people for the gas chambers

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.920
and human experimentation in Auschwitz.)

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:45.800
Experimentation and objectification is a constant
theme in final fantasy. In 8, Edea is possessed

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:50.980
by Ultimecia to help advance her mastetr plan
to posses people in several time lines. Celeste

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:55.040
is created through genetic engineering in
final fantasy six. In final fantasy thirteen

00:10:55.040 --> 00:11:00.310
Cocoon is a giant production facility to create
human thralls for the Fal’C and just like

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:04.620
prison sex, Kuja does what is done to him,
creating a production facility of black mage

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:09.360
dolls as weapons that reflect his own empty
puppet like existence as a genome.

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:14.040
Also- trains. Final Fantasy six has the phantom
train, final Fantasy seven has several trains,

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:16.990
final Fantasy eight has the timber train,
Final Fantasy nine has an air cab that is

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:20.970
a sort of monorail, Final Fantasy twelve has
abandoned railroad tracks everywhere and in

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:24.610
Final Fantasy thirteen trains transport l’cie
to their mass extermination.

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:28.670
The role of railroads are significant given
the history of their use for the acceleration

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:32.940
of the mass exodus and elimination of people
in Nazi Germany - and through facilitating

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:36.630
the extermination of the native people of
North America through the expansion of the

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:38.829
western border into indigenous lands.

00:11:38.829 --> 00:11:42.860
Trainshave always been symbol of technological advancement—they stand as the archetype

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:45.380
of the industrial revolution and manifest destiny.

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:49.340
In Dostoyevsky's 'The Idiot', trains were even a symbol of the Antichrist.

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:51.720
As a sort of bad omen trains are a reminder

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:56.480
of the power of technology and the responsibility
that comes with wielding immense power.

00:11:56.480 --> 00:12:01.050
Whether it be medieval times or space epics, in Final Fantasy, magic is treated pretty

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:04.420
similar to technology and in some instances they are used interchangeably.

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:09.070
It isn’t a question of technology or magic
being bad in and of itself—the responsibility

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:15.630
lies in hands that use the tools or cast the spells.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:20.660
Final Fantasy, in the end, is about the unbreakable human spirit, about overcoming impossible

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:25.130
odds, of persevering when success seems like
a pipe dream or fantasy—it’s about the

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:29.000
power of friendship, love, and the transformative
potential of hope...

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:31.050
No one decides to sacrifice their

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:35.970
lives in Final Fantasy ten—they all choose
to accept a world of death, suffering, and

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:39.769
pain. All the party members in Final Fantasy
seven find a reason to fight for the planet,

00:12:39.769 --> 00:12:43.740
in Final Fantasy nine the party fights against
Necron and asserts a will to live.

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:47.149
Even angst filled Vivi finds the will to make
little Vivi babies.

00:12:47.149 --> 00:12:52.440
In Final Fantasy six they respond to Kefka’s
nihilism with “it’s the day to day concerns,

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:56.080
personal victories, and the celebration of
life and love...that matters.”

